A vibrant cyberpunk cityscape of Singapore at night, neon-lit skyscrapers towering against a dark purple sky, holographic corporate logos floating between buildings. In the foreground, a lone figure sits on a rooftop edge, back to viewer, gazing at a massive glowing Microsoft headquarters building across the bay, bustling with activity and streaming data particles. In contrast, a smaller abandoned building nearby sits dark and forgotten, overgrown with luminescent vines, its windows cracked and empty. The scene captures isolation amid technological celebration, with rain-slicked surfaces reflecting the stark divide between the vibrant conference energy and the quiet neglect. Flying vehicles streak past the active building while none approach the forgotten structure. Electric blues, hot pinks, and deep shadows dominate the palette.
